 "fetched": "2026-11-28T01:10:34Z",
 "definition": "The crop production index measures changes in the aggregate volume of crop production relative to the 2014–2016 base period (2014–2016 = 100). Production quantities are weighted by average 2014–2016 international commodity prices and aggregated using a Laspeyres formula. To avoid double counting, quantities used as seed originating from the crop sector are deducted. The index includes all crops except fodder crops.",
 "indicator": "AG.PRD.CROP.XD",
 "source_response_sha256": "b3d82841b0b891c2d7ca380a497df0f07653d33e47aeb6d32b094a301ef77811",
